  DisplayName: Riptide
  Description: 'Goby and Pistol only - wide plates of prisms hang in the cell. From the Goby, dart your
    islands past the plates. From the Pistol, the undertow pulls their tiles into your plane
    - fire vortex rings to gather them and smash them, and break what you touch. Rival
    trails and dens count too. Higher intensities turn the plates, stack them, and brace
    them with shielded ribs. First team to the target wins.'
